    "text": "The hybridisation of phosphorous in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is"
